{"text": "The fastest way to lower your stress is to stop trying to control or change anyone else, and let people be exactly who they are.\n\nLet them think what they think. Let them do what they do. Let them feel what they feel. Instead of pouring your energy outward, return it inward. To your breath. To your own actions. To your own heart.\n\nBecause one of the biggest sources of stress in this world is other people. Loud, unkind, full of expectations and guilt that were never meant for you to carry.\n\nOne of the greatest freedoms is realizing you no longer need to fight their storms. Let them be who they have always been. Especially your family. Your family has been the same since the day you were born. Why exhaust your spirit hoping they will suddenly become someone else?\n\nYou cannot change another person. But you can choose peace today.\n\nComment stress, and I will send you the practice.\n\nLetting them be will quiet your day. It will not teach your body to stay calm when they walk back in. Everything I know is inside The Quiet Between Thoughts. The link is in my profile.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "f", "a", "s", "t", "e", "s", "t", " ", "w", "a", "y", " ", "t", "o", " ", "l", "o", "w", "e", "r", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "s", "t", "r", "e", "s", "s", " ", "i", "s", " ", "t", "o", " ", "s", "t", "o", "p", " ", "t", "r", "y", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "o", " ", "c", "o", "n", "t", "r", "o", "l", " ", "o", "r", " ", "c", "h", "a", "n", "g", "e", " ", "a", "n", "y", "o", "n", "e", " ", "e", "l", "s", "e", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "l", "e", "t", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", " ", "b", "e", " ", "e", "x", "a", "c", "t", "l", "y", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "a", "r", "e", ".", "\n", "\n", "L", "e", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", " ", "t", "h", "i", "n", "k", " ", "w", "h", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "t", "h", "i", "n", "k", ".", " ", "L", "e", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", " ", "d", "o", " ",